# local test & benchmark environment.
# Copy to `.env` (which is gitignored) and fill in values.
#
# Without TRUFFLE_TEST_AUTHKEY set, real-network tests and benchmarks
# will skip gracefully. Mock-based tests and micro benchmarks always run.
#
# How to get an auth key:
#   1. Go to https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys
#   2. Generate an auth key with: Reusable, Ephemeral, Tags: tag:truffle-test
#      (and Pre-approved if device approval is enabled on your tailnet)
#   3. Ensure your tailnet ACL grants `tag:truffle-test` as an ownerless tag.
#      See docs/TESTING.md for a snippet.
#
# See docs/TESTING.md for the full walkthrough.

# REQUIRED for real-network tests & benches. Leave unset to skip them.
TRUFFLE_TEST_AUTHKEY=

# Ghosttea mirroring uses the latest Truffle Rust runtime from the sibling
# p008/truffle checkout. A test auth key also enables it during local dev.
# Set this to false when you only want to run local terminal sessions.
# The Electron demo resolves the sibling development sidecar automatically;
# a consuming app owns this path and its Truffle runtime lifecycle.
# TRUFFLE_SIDECAR_PATH=/path/to/sidecar-slim
# GHOSTTEA_TRUFFLE_ENABLED=true
# GHOSTTEA_TRUFFLE_APP_ID=ghosttea-terminal
# GHOSTTEA_TRUFFLE_SERVICE=terminal.v1
# GHOSTTEA_TRUFFLE_PORT=9420
# GHOSTTEA_TRUFFLE_DEVICE_NAME= # normally derived from the desktop profile
# GHOSTTEA_TRUFFLE_STATE_DIR=  # normally derived from the desktop profile

# Tailnet peers are read-only by default. Choose one write policy:
# GHOSTTEA_TRUFFLE_CAPABILITY=       # shared capability supplied on attach
# GHOSTTEA_TRUFFLE_ALLOW_WRITE=false # trust every same-app tailnet peer

# Optional overrides (defaults shown):
# TRUFFLE_TEST_TAGS=      # comma-separated tags to advertise. LEAVE UNSET
                          # unless your tailnet ACL has a matching tagOwners
                          # entry — the auth key's own tag applies
                          # automatically. Set only for explicit overrides.
# TRUFFLE_TEST_EPHEMERAL=true
# TRUFFLE_TEST_LOG=truffle_core=info
# TRUFFLE_TEST_STATE_ROOT=
